{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"屯門有工業大廈棚架起火　無人受傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FIRE-TM-261128-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】屯門有工業大廈棚架起火，逾二百人疏散，無人受傷。</p><p>從網上片段見到，大廈外牆棚架冒出火舌，部分棚網正在燃燒，濃煙升上半空。</p><p>現場是屯門建發里2號一座工業大廈。火警大約於下午2時發生，消防接報後派出一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約四十分後火警大致被救熄。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:36:39.414714+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:02:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:31:25.320547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T09:30:24.623999+00:00","content_hash":"bb47640e5f9172a2aebb6abfc368aab3f9170be66922238a7421528ef5550925","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:36:39.414714+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}